# 🧠 TODAY'S FORMULA CARD

### Basic work

$$
\boxed{Work=Efficiency\times Time}
$$

### Daily work

$$
\boxed{Daily\ Work=\frac1{Time}}
$$

### Combined work

$$
\boxed{Rate_{total}=Rate_1+Rate_2+\cdots}
$$

### Men & Days

$$
\boxed{M_1D_1=M_2D_2}
$$

### Men, Days & Hours

$$
\boxed{M_1D_1H_1=M_2D_2H_2}
$$

### Efficiency

$$
\boxed{Efficiency\propto\frac1{Time}}
$$

### Pipes

$$
\boxed{Filling=+,\ Emptying=-}
$$

---

# 🧠 60-SECOND MEMORY TRICK

When you see:

> **"A can finish in X days."**

Immediately think:

$$
\boxed{A's\ rate=1/X}
$$

When multiple people work:

> **ADD RATES**

When a pipe empties:

> **SUBTRACT RATE**

When workers/days change:

> **WORK = CONSTANT**

That's the entire foundation of Time & Work.

